"on or off"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:542
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, KDE will show a confirmation dialog whenever a "
"keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off.\n"
"Be carefull to know what you are doing if you uncheck it as then the keyboard "
"accessibility settings will always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""

